  - Protect Customer Payment Data applies. The mail credential is read from the secrets store, and no payment data is read.
  - The GitHub Actions scheduled-workflow syntax matches the current documentation. Source: [Events that trigger workflows, GitHub Docs](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/events-that-trigger-workflows). No correction was needed for that.
  **Here is a proposed starting point for your codify feature:**
  **Title:** Send the weekly restock alert email
